    "http://careers.sru.edu/": {
      "title": "Welcome to Slippery Rock University's Career Site",
      "description": "Slippery Rock University | Home Skip to Main Content STUDENTS FACULTY AND STAFF ADMINISTRATION ALUMNI, FRIENDS, GIVING PARENTS ADMISSIONS ACADEMICS CAMPUS LIFE ATHLETICS ABOUT SRU NEWS and INFO Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help About SRU Human Resources Diversity and Equal Opportunity Benefits Directions Visitors and Community Welcome to Slippery Rock University's Career Site Coach Positions Faculty Positions Management Positions Professional Positions Staff Positions Attention Applicants: Slippery Rock University has recently updated to a new version of our Employment Site. You will need to create a new account and application to apply to any new jobs going forward. Any application you previously submitted online with Slippery Rock University will remain active until it is filled, but you will not be able to see its status online. Please enjoy the new look, feel, and features available now on our employment site, such as Bookmarks, Email a Friend, RSS feeds, and more! To begin Searching for Job Openings, please click \"Search Jobs\" in the left navigation section. To apply for Job Openings, please create an account by clicking the \"Create Account\" link. If you have any questions or need assistance, please contact Human Resources at 724-738-2070 for staff, coach, and professional postings. Faculty and management posting questions/requests for assistance should be directed to Diversity & Equal Opportunity at 724-738-2016. Slippery Rock University, with a student population of nearly 8,500 and some 950 employees, is a wonderful place to work no matter what your career aspirations are. The University prides itself on being inclusive, welcoming and small town friendly. The campus blends beauty and history and is expansive, with over 600 rolling acres. Slippery Rock, while convenient to major metropolitan centers such as Pittsburgh, Cleveland and Erie, offers a rural surrounding area with much to see and do. SRU employees appreciate how convenient the University is to things they value such as housing, education, medical care, shopping and recreation. As a member university of the Pennsylvania State System of Higher Education, SRU employees are state employees of the Commonwealth. Slippery Rock University offers competitive salaries and wages, a comprehensive benefit package, and a number of retirement options. This site is dedicated to assisting individuals interested in working at Slippery Rock University. To make application to a position that interests you, please follow the steps provided and make sure to complete all required fields. Do not hesitate to contact the site administrators should you experience any difficulty completing the various sections of the application. It's a great time to be at Slippery Rock University! To see our current open positions, please click on a Job Category above: New Users To search positions, click the Search Jobs link on the navigation bar. To apply for a job, click the Create Account link on the navigation bar, then search jobs. You will be prompted to create an application if you have not done so before. Returning Users Click the Login link on the navigation bar, and enter your username and password. This enables you to: Edit your existing account settings. Apply to new jobs. Review the status of positions you have applied to. Email postings to a friend ADMISSIONS Undergraduate Graduate International Financial Aid/Costs Orientation Visit ACADEMICS Majors and Minors Graduate Programs Academic Departments Colleges Library Academic Services CAMPUS LIFE Living on campus Dining Bookstore Wellness Volunteering Get Involved SPORTS Intercollegiate Athletics Intramural Sports Club Sports Recreation Center Sports Information Rock Athletic Club ABOUT SRU University Profile Accountability Extended Learning Community Employment Arts and Culture NEWS & INFO News Releases Events, Tickets, Calendars Directories Campus Map top of the rock rockpride online Copyright Slippery Rock University of Pennsylvania • 1 Morrow Way Slippery Rock, PA 16057 • Webmaster • Right to Know Policy • Sitemap • Login To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
    }
